OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATraders must raise #50m to buy
OL,4,ABrixton Village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of traders, residents and
OL,7,Fcommunity organisers in south London
OL,8,Fnamed as the preferred buyer for
OL,9,FBrixton Village and Market Row must now
OL,10,Fraise #50m within six months to buy the
OL,11,Fsites.
OL,13,FThe Buy Back Brixton group said it had
OL,14,Freached an agreement with the owners to
OL,15,Fcomplete the purchase within the agreed
OL,16,Ftime limit after its bid competed
OL,17,Fagainst commercial developers.
OL,19,FThe group has so far received #6.5m in
OL,20,Fpledges and crowdfunded more than
OL,21,F#579,000.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
