OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATraders must raise #50m to buy
OL,4,ABrixton Village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the current owners,
OL,7,FTPG AG Real Estate and Hondo
OL,8,FEnterprises, said they were "delighted"
OL,9,Fto name the group as the preferred
OL,10,Fbuyer, and said it had a "compelling,
OL,11,Fmission-driven proposal for the
OL,12,Fmarket's future".
